    {
      "id": "lfs-33",
      "name": "Workflow overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1740,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 650,
        "content": "## Qualify and approve a live face-swap session\n\nThis template turns a face-swap request into a consent-aware production handoff: intake, URL safety, two independent asset inspections, effect-specific preparation, and a human decision.\n\n**It does not identify people or run a face swap.** Configure execution-data retention before accepting personal images. The manual branch is a complete executable sample using project-owned assets."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lfs-34",
      "name": "1. Intake and authorization",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1220,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## 1. Intake and authorization\n\nThe public form collects requester contact, two short-lived HTTPS URLs, effect, channel, and explicit ownership/consent. Authorization failures stop before either URL is fetched."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lfs-35",
      "name": "2. Download and inspect both assets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -20,
        -600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1500,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## 2. Download and inspect both assets\n\nEach file is fetched only after HTTPS/private-host checks, then inspected independently for a real JPG/PNG/WebP signature, dimensions, size, and extreme crop. Failures return asset-specific corrections."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lfs-36",
      "name": "3. Effect-specific preparation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1520,
        -760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## 3. Effect-specific preparation\n\nVisible branches produce different checklists for Face Swap, Try-On, and Restyle. The packet also carries the source/reference reports and a clear product boundary."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lfs-37",
      "name": "4. Human review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2560,
        -760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 780,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## 4. Human review\n\nReal submissions pause on a second n8n form for Approve / Request changes / Reject. The executable sample bypasses the wait with a clearly marked demo-only approval so reviewers can run the whole workflow immediately."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lfs-38",
      "name": "5. Actionable outcomes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3320,
        -760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 900,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## 5. Actionable outcomes\n\nApproved requests receive a private-test handoff and LiveFaceSwap setup links. Change and rejection paths retain reviewer notes and do not imply that transformation has already occurred."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
